sequenceDiagram
    participant UI
    participant API as Evaluation API
    participant Q as Worker (concurrency-capped · default 2)
    participant AG as Conversation Orchestrator
    participant DS as Data store
    UI->>API: POST /api/v2/runs/response {dataset_id, agent, judge?}
    API-->>UI: 202 {id}
    Q->>Q: Wait for a global queue slot — pending · 60s heartbeat
    Q->>DS: Integrity check + pre-create every result row
    loop Per row (all-lost rows skipped · semaphore)
        Q->>Q: Generate per-call UUID → store request ID first
        Q->>AG: Live-service query (trace header = UUID · fresh thread)
        AG-->>Q: {chatlog ID, thread ID} — stored on receipt
        loop Polling (every 5–10s · timeout mandatory)
            Q->>DS: Fetch chatlog result
            DS-->>Q: Processing status
        end
        alt Completed normally
            Q->>DS: Fetch prompt → confirm the model actually used
            Q->>Q: Store response (answer · passages · gold usage · model mismatch)
        else Error / length / abort / timeout
            Q->>Q: Mark failed — passages preserved when present
        end
        Q->>Q: progress +1
    end
    Q->>Q: Response stage done → with a judge configured, release the slot and re-queue for judgment
